<section class="section wrap about-story"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Why Elite Clean Pro</p><h2>Booking a clean<br><em>should feel simple.</em></h2></div><div class="story-copy"><p>Life gets busy. Finding help with cleaning shouldn’t become another job on your list. Elite Clean Pro was created to make it easier to plan a home clean around your needs.</p><p>For a regular visit, that means agreeing on the rooms and priorities. For a move-out, it means reviewing details such as appliance interiors, empty cabinets and your handover checklist before the work begins.</p><p>You review a written quote and cleaning checklist before accepting. If you have questions before or after your visit, contact <a href="mailto:hello@elitecleanpro.ca">hello@elitecleanpro.ca</a>.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap standards-block"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / What you can expect</p><h2>Trust starts<br><em>with the specifics.</em></h2></div><p>Letting someone into your home is personal. Here’s what we agree with you before the visit.</p></div><div class="standards-grid"><article><span class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Your checklist, in writing.</h3><p>The rooms, surfaces and extras are listed in your quote, so you can check the plan before accepting.</p></article><article><span class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>A price you review first.</h3><p>Your estimate is a starting point. You approve the written quote before we confirm the appointment.</p></article><article><span class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Access agreed with you.</h3><p>We discuss the visit and access arrangements before confirming. Keep door and alarm codes out of the enquiry form.</p></article><article><span class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>A direct contact afterwards.</h3><p>If something needs attention, email us with the details so we can review it against the agreed work.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section wrap about-detail"><div class="about-detail-photo"><img src="/assets/img/mount-royal-home.webp" width="800" height="1000" alt="A home surrounded by green trees" loading="lazy"><span>For the home you live in.<br>And the one you’re leaving.</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Your home, your priorities</p><h2>A clean that follows<br><em>your home’s needs.</em></h2><p>Tell us which rooms need attention, what surfaces need care, and what you want help with. We’ll agree on the work before confirming your visit.</p><details><summary>Moving out? Start with the checklist.</summary><p>Share your landlord’s checklist and key handover date. We’ll review the cleaning tasks and agree on what is included. Cleaning cannot guarantee a deposit return or settle a tenancy dispute.</p></details><details><summary>Want to know more about your visit?</summary><p>Ask about the cleaner, supplies and any household needs before accepting your quote. We agree on access and cleaner availability before confirming the appointment.</p></details></div></section>
